{"version":1,"content":"<p>前TVB藝人吳家樂近日接受梁靖琪網上節目訪問，大談入行多年心路歷程。</p><p>吳家樂於2006年與50億太子女周蕙蕙結婚，外父離世後，有1.89億股全部交予5女周蕙蕙繼承，吳家樂被外界冠上「50億駙馬」標籤，吳家樂早已豁達面對：「其實我已經習慣了！</p><p>我</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:19:14.999406+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T09:12:16.636277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:12:16.636277+00:00","content_hash":"4e221453b29b07eb7e365cf81512088cb02f0b4bd98d0e79ce3f52adae77987d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}